                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7cca8b28-f8b8-4c35-a6f9-f841e6ee6bb7",
                                "sense_id": "42964442-c178-36c9-8c05-f552270b565d",
                                "text": "Само́ происше́ствие заста́ло Го́лубева в тот моме́нт, когда́ он вме́сте с однору́ким счетово́дом Во́лковым проверя́л ба́бу Ду́ню на предме́т самогоноваре́ния.",
                                "translation": "The whole affair had caught Golubev just as he and Volkov, the one-armed bookkeeper, had been questioning Granny Dunya on the subject of her home brew.",
                                "english": "The whole affair had caught Golubev just as he and Volkov, the one-armed bookkeeper, had been questioning Granny Dunya on the subject of her home brew."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
